msgid "Forecast Tools"
msgstr "Prognosverktyg"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1145
msgid "Exponential Smoothing Tool"
msgstr "Verktyg för exponentiell utjämning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1148
msgid "Exponential Smoothing Tool Dialog"
msgstr "Dialogrutan för exponentiell utjämning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1150
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-smoothing.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the "
"exponential smoothing dialog.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-smoothing.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Dialogrutan för "
"exponentiell utjämning.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1163
msgid ""
"The Exponential Smoothing tool performs the exponential smoothing for the "
"given set or sets of values. It provides the choice of 5 different "
"exponential smoothing methods:"
msgstr ""
"Verktyget för exponentiell utjämning jämnar ut en eller flera värdeserier "
"exponentiellt. Du kan välja mellan fem olika metoder:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1169
msgid "Simple exponential smoothing according to (Hunter, 1968)."
msgstr "Enkel exponentiell utjämning enligt Hunter (1968)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1172
msgid "Simple exponential smoothing according to (Roberts, 1959)."
msgstr "Enkel exponentiell utjämning enligt Roberts (1959)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1175
msgid ""
"Holt's trend corrected exponential smoothing (occasionally also referred to "
"as double exponential smoothing)"
msgstr ""
"Holts trendkorrigerade exponentiella utjämning (ibland även kallad dubbel "
"exponentiell utjämning)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1182
msgid ""
"Multiplicative Holt-Winters exponential smoothing (occasionally also "
"referred to as triple exponential smoothing)"
msgstr ""
"Multiplikativ exponentiell utjämning enligt Holt–Winters (ibland även kallad"
" trippel exponentiell utjämning)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1187
msgid ""
"Since the kind of options available depend on the type of exponential "
"smoothing desired, you can choose the type on the <quote><guilabel>Input "
"</guilabel></quote> page."
msgstr ""
"Vilka alternativ som är tillgängliga beror på vilken typ av exponentiell "
"utjämning du väljer. Välj typ på sidan <quote><guilabel>Indata "
"</guilabel></quote>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1194
msgid "Common Options of the Exponential Smoothing Tool"
msgstr "Gemensamma alternativ för verktyget för exponentiell utjämning"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1196 C/gnumeric.xml:1801
msgid ""
"Specify the cells containing the datasets in the <quote><guilabel>Input "
"Range</guilabel></quote> entry. The entered range or ranges are grouped into"
" datasets either by rows or by columns."
msgstr ""
"Ange cellerna med datamängderna i fältet "
"<quote><guilabel>Indataområde</guilabel></quote>. Området eller områdena "
"delas in i datamängder efter rader eller kolumner."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1204
msgid ""
"If you select the <quote><guilabel>Include chart</guilabel></quote> option, "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> will also create a chart showing both "
"the data and corresponding smoothed values."
msgstr ""
"Om du väljer <quote><guilabel>Inkludera diagram</guilabel></quote> skapar "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> även ett diagram som visar både data och"
" motsvarande utjämnade värden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1212
msgid "Exponential Smoothing According to Hunter"
msgstr "Exponentiell utjämning enligt Hunter"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1214
msgid ""
"Each value in the smoothed set is predicted based on the forecast for the "
"prior period. The formula is given in <xref linkend=\"exp-smoothing-tool-"
"formula-hunter\"/>. α is the value given as <quote><guilabel>Damping "
"factor</guilabel></quote>. <parameter>y<subscript>t</subscript></parameter> "
"is the <parameter>t</parameter>th value in the original data set and "
"<parameter>l<subscript>t</subscript></parameter> the corresponding smoothed "
"value."
msgstr ""
"Varje värde i den utjämnade serien beräknas utifrån prognosen för föregående"
" period. Formeln finns i <xref linkend=\"exp-smoothing-tool-formula-"
"hunter\"/>. α är värdet i fältet "
"<quote><guilabel>Dämpningsfaktor</guilabel></quote>. "
"<parameter>y<subscript>t</subscript></parameter> är värdet på plats "
"<parameter>t</parameter> i den ursprungliga serien, och "
"<parameter>l<subscript>t</subscript></parameter> är motsvarande utjämnade "
"värde."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1223
msgid "Exponential Smoothing Formula According To Hunter"
msgstr "Formel för exponentiell utjämning enligt Hunter"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1225
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-exp-smoothing-"
"hunter-formula.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> "
"<phrase>The formula used in exponential smoothing according to "
"Hunter.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-exp-smoothing-"
"hunter-formula.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> "
"<phrase>Formeln för exponentiell utjämning enligt Hunter.</phrase> "
"</textobject>"
